# Temporary HP48gII serial Kermit receive probe.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 capture home
# APPS -> I/O functions -> Transfer.
8000 tap files
9500 tap down
10000 tap enter
11500 tap down
12000 tap down
12500 tap down
13000 tap down
14000 tap enter
# Transfer opens with Name focused. Select Port -> Serial.
16000 tap up
17000 tap f2
18000 tap down
18500 tap enter
19500 capture port-serial
# Accept Transfer settings and return to HOME.
20000 tap enter
21500 capture serial-settings-accepted
# APPS -> I/O functions -> Start Server.
22000 tap files
23500 tap down
24000 tap enter
25000 tap down
25500 tap down
26000 tap down
26500 tap down
27000 tap down
27500 capture start-server-serial
28000 tap enter
30000 capture server-serial
# Host sends L275_48 and FINISHes after this point.
39000 capture after-transfer
40000 tap var
41000 capture vars
45000 finish-install
